# Load order matters: Core.lua defines the shared "ns" table the other files use,
# and Options.lua dispatches /sink items, /sink recipes, /sink weapons, /sink errors,
# /sink map and /sink dump to the modules; /sink splits and /sink tracker flip the Splits.lua and
# Tracker.lua switches. Tracker.lua lists dungeons from Quests.lua. MapPins.xml holds the map pin template that
# MapPins.lua fills in; Dump.lua uses helpers from Recipes.lua, Weapons.lua and MapPins.lua.
Core.lua
QuestItems.lua
Recipes.lua
Weapons.lua
Trainers.lua
Errors.lua
Quests.lua
Splits.lua
Tracker.lua
MapPins.lua
MapPins.xml
Dump.lua
Options.lua
